PicoTTS and SVOX Pico notice

SolarOS obtains the PicoTTS source from
https://github.com/DiUS/esp-picotts at commit
bf1a8df9d2be1e088a03a775d439ac66e18438dc.

The SolarOS adapter loads language resources from storage at runtime instead
of embedding them in the application image. Its wrapper is derived from the
upstream ESP-IDF integration under the same Apache-2.0 terms.

The ESP-IDF integration is Copyright (C) 2024 DiUS Computing Pty Ltd.

The PicoTTS engine and bundled language resources carry this upstream notice:

Copyright (C) 2008-2009 SVOX AG, Baslerstr. 30, 8048 Zuerich, Switzerland

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in
the SolarOS repository root as LICENSE.md. The fetched component also retains
the upstream source headers and pico/lib/NOTICE.
